<title>USA: Gibson Greetings names president, CEO.</title>
<headline>Gibson Greetings names president, CEO.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gibson Greetings Inc said on Monday it elected Frank O'Connell as president and chief executive.</p>
<p>O'Connell was chief executive of Skybox International before selling it to Marvel Entertainment Group Inc in May 1995. Since then, O'Connell has worked as a consultant.</p>
<p>Albert Pezzillo, who was the interim chairman and chief executive, will continue as chairman of the board, Gibson said.</p>
